    skos:altLabel "Communication"@en ;
    skos:definition "Communication connectivity attributes."@en ;
    skos:editorialNote "Internal hierarchy: CommunicationType (CommunicationTypeFleetManagement, CommunicationTypeTrafficManagement, CommunicationTypeV2X (CommunicationV2i, CommunicationV2v, CommunicationV2N, CommunicationV2P)); CommunicationTechnology (Cellular, DSRC, ITS-G5, Satellite, Sidelink PC5, WLAN); CommunicationDownlink and CommunicationUplink (Latency, Throughput)."@en,
        "The former combined values V2iCellular, V2iSatellite, V2iWifi, V2vCellular, V2vSatellite and V2vWifi were removed; combine a type value with a technology value instead."@en,
        "v1 label: \"Communication\" (PAS 1883:2020, Section 5.3.4.a)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ascs-ev/envited-x/openlabel/v2> ;
    skos:note "ISO 34503:2023, 10.5 a)"@en ;
